.claude/
CLAUDE.md
HANDOFF.md
scripts/hooks/
tests/test_context_handoff_hook.py
.superpowers/
.playwright-mcp/
frontend/e2e/screenshots*/
frontend/test-results/
frontend/playwright-report/

# agent implementation plans: local working files
docs/design/plans/
